{
  "_comment": [
    "Seasonal theme packs. Each pack sets the neutral ground and ONE sharp accent;",
    "category hues stay constant across packs so Anna never has to relearn what a",
    "colour means. Every pack ships light and dark variants -- the page follows the",
    "viewer's prefers-color-scheme within whichever pack is chosen.",
    "Contrast is verified by tools/check_contrast.py; do not hand-edit without rerunning it."
  ],
  "default": "floral",
  "order": [
    "floral",
    "autumn",
    "halloween",
    "thanksgiving",
    "winter",
    "newyear"
  ],
